# vu0_aot.py: SHA-256 of each VU0 image's program words (pairs 0..n-1, lower then upper word, little-endian), as
# load_textbin decodes them from the decomp's assembly/assets/vu/game_<addr>.textbin.bin or from SLUS_210.50's DMA chain
# at <addr> (--elf). The generated C++ (gen/native/vu0/vu0_aot_gen.cpp, committed) carries these hashes and the
# translated programs, not the microcode words; Vu0Unit matches the micro memory by them. Fields: address, pairs, sha256.
